1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,800
Hi! We're Chia and Jacy, team BoboMimi.

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:05,500
Our challenge: the Earth Information Jukebox.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,400
This is TerraJuke. Hear NASA's view of our planet.

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:13,800
Pick a NASA picture and press Play.
Warmer places play higher notes.

5
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:18,900
Touch any place to hear its story, from 1890 to today.

6
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:24,300
Eight NASA records, with captions and keyboard control.

7
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:30,000
Imagine every Earth Information Center screen,
one you could also hear. TerraJuke!
